  "description": "The CB-B88S bag is an ideal carrying solution for slim 88-note keyboards such as the RD-88 EX, FP-30X, and other Roland portable piano models. Whether using the comfortable carrying handle or padded shoulder strap, getting around town is easy with this quality bag.\n\nThe CB-B88S protects your portable piano while traveling to gigs, lessons, and jam sessions. It features a durable polyester exterior and a thick padded interior with soft fleece lining, plus two internal hook-and-loop straps to secure the instrument and eliminate movement.\n\nThe CB-B88S features a cushioned handle for short walks and moving the bag, along with a removable shoulder strap that\u2019s attached diagonally for stability and comfort while carrying your instrument over longer distances.\n\nThe CB-B88S has a large pocket for storing pedals, cables, AC cords, and other accessories, plus a slim pocket for a smartphone, music notes, and other smaller items.\n\nExcellent Protection\n\nCarrying Comfort\n\nTwo Storage Pockets",
